note.p:
During the next month Stassen assembled a Special Staff to study the problem of
                    disarmament. The members were as follows: Robert E. Matteson, Staff Director;
                    Colonel Raymond B. Firehock, Deputy Staff Director; Edmund A. Gullion; Lawrence
                    D. Weiler; Colonel Benjamin G. Willis, USAF; McKay Donkin; Frederick Janney;
                    Captain Donald W. Gladney, USN; and John F. Lippmann.
